<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:37:49Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>裝扮成哈利波特，公開質疑泰國王室——他如今面臨34年監禁</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3r52e814pqo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:37:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T07:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3r52e814pqo/trad--913d95605828.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3r52e814pqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自2020年以來，泰國已有294人因涉嫌違反冒犯君主罪而被起訴，刑期最長達50年。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會「空椅子」背後：常態化高壓反腐如何改變中國官場？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T13:23:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad--eb04c414483a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「這次全會進一步表明，習近平的反腐運動沒有終點。」專家說，「持續施加紀律壓力不應只是階段性運動，而必須成為中共運作方式中永久存在的一部分。」</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣新北市長選戰：「政二代」蘇巧慧對決「專業副手」李四川，誰能拿下藍綠關鍵一城？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T11:31:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad--d30d3a72b78c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為全台人口最多的直轄市，新北市被視為「最關鍵戰場」，將判定藍綠整體勝負，並可能牽動2028年總統大選。</summary></entry><entry><title>朝鮮「精英」黑客組織是誰？為何成為幣安63億美元盜竊案的頭號嫌疑者？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:37:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T07:02:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad--d11d069da814.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqe8rpl8wjd0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果有關指控屬實，這宗破紀錄的盜竊案顯示，涉嫌來自朝鮮的黑客如今已擁有多麼強大的能力。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國施壓下姆巴佩道歉，但許多人仍不知道他究竟說了什麼</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T00:23:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad--0f6a387da94b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">姆巴佩有關一名「中國領導人」的言論引發眾怒，但網絡審查令許多人仍不清楚事件究竟是怎麼回事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼歐洲各國年輕人走上街頭？背後的共同訴求和暴力隱憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T03:52:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad--af7f5220a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">過去一個月，歐洲各地爆發了由青年主導的示威遊行。這些遊行活動有何共同點？</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會閉幕：出席委員較本屆初減少四分之一 張升民罕見增選入政治局</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmr4y17q4vxxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T13:01:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmr4y17q4vxxo/trad--5a421a730590.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmr4y17q4vxxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家稱，更好的激勵與監督可能減少浪費、提高政策可預期性，但更嚴厲的紀律約束也可能加深幹部不敢作為的局面，拖延支出和投資。</summary></entry><entry><title>幣安遭黑客攻擊：涉63億美元 或為史上最大規模 朝鮮黑客組織被指涉案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw0k023x733lo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T09:56:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw0k023x733lo/trad--785b489c835d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw0k023x733lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">兩家分析公司已將事件歸咎於「TraderTraitor」。人工智能調查公司TRM Labs在一份報告中稱，幣安攻擊事件的多個要素與早前和朝鮮有關的事件相似，包括2025年Bybit交易所創紀錄的15億美元黑客攻擊。另一家加密分析公司Chainalysis也表示，「高度確信」該朝鮮組織與這次黑客攻擊有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港宏福苑大火報告公開：特首率官員鞠躬道歉，房屋局長請辭</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c95ynv03lmk8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T14:47:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c95ynv03lmk8o/trad--1277bff9a65b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c95ynv03lmk8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這場造成168人死亡的大火發生將近一年後，香港特首李家超首次率領官員鞠躬道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我不希望它成為我的身份」：Hyrox失禁選手復出比賽前接受BBC專訪</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T05:40:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad--7b3627bd5422.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這位澳洲運動員承認責任，但表示輿論反彈令她「創傷」。</summary></entry><entry><title>巴西前總統博索納羅之子敗給盧拉後，為何飛往美國？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T16:19:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad--c7ae9b4196f6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這位參議員離開巴西後，被拍到在美國走下飛機。他在巴西因涉嫌洗錢而接受調查。</summary></entry><entry><title>印中關係緩和之際：印邊境官員稱中國軍隊大批集結並搭帳篷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T00:23:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad--c22ccb93b383.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印中關係原本正處於謹慎的復甦階段，直到一位邊境官員的言論引發了人們對實際情況的新疑慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣地方選舉五大看點：「洋流」能否撼動台北？誰在卡位2028？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:45:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad--4fc64a9bc6d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共是否介入台灣選舉？ 這次選舉將如何影響賴清德與國民黨主席鄭麗文的政治能量？捲土重來、希望藉著地方議員選舉有所斬獲的小黨，此次結盟能否在主流政黨夾殺中突圍而出？</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平之後，中國將走向何方？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T09:28:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad--3e76c4ad96f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著習近平打破傳統任期慣例，未來的權力繼承路徑與接班陣容充滿變數。權力交接、接班人選，以及習近平未來角色的討論，正在成為中國政治最受關注、也最難回答的問題之一。習近平之後，中國會走向何方？</summary></entry><entry><title>蔣萬安、沈伯洋台北市長選舉辯論會交鋒</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm3el2ewgvx0o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:37:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T13:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm3el2ewgvx0o/trad--d60c64b780d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm3el2ewgvx0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">距離台灣「九合一」地方選舉不足一個月，在台北，中國國民黨籍現任市長蔣萬安將與台灣執政民進黨候選人沈伯洋出席首場電視辯論會。</summary></entry><entry><title>暗影人物：與烏克蘭合作的俄羅斯人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T09:31:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad--33f01a49f189.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從線人和秘密網絡，到破壞行動及暗殺的指控，俄羅斯與烏克蘭之間的戰爭，正越來越多地在遠離戰場的地方展開。
這場暗影戰爭的許多細節難以核實。不過，《BBC之眼》罕有地接觸到一些俄羅斯人。他們聲稱，自己正通過在俄羅斯境內執行行動，以協助烏克蘭。BBC已確認他們為烏克蘭情報機構工作，但未能獨立核實他們所稱參與的行動。</summary></entry><entry><title>《孤獨的美食家》：一個人吃飯，為什麼能紅遍全亞洲？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T09:37:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad--61c836c7fe01.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">開播至今14年，《孤獨的美食家》從日本深夜劇成長為風靡亞洲的電視作品。觀眾跟隨主角井之頭五郎穿梭街巷尋找美食和故事。主演松重豐希望讓更多海外觀眾透過美食認識日本文化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美沙冬是毒還是藥？從香港經驗看台灣選戰戒毒爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T08:57:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad--3e0e93250f10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台北市長選舉引發對「美沙冬」（香港稱「美沙酮」）與毒品減害政策的論戰，然而在海峽對岸的香港，這項計劃已運作超過半世紀。為什麼醫學界將其視為有效降低犯罪與血液傳染病的「減害」關鍵？</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>姆巴佩就「中國獨裁者」迷因道歉 背後的資訊真空與「毛澤東熱」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T05:27:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad--854c8c0f141b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">因在節目中以「獨裁者」形容已故中國領導人毛澤東，法國足球明星基利安·姆巴佩（麥巴比）近日在中國引發爭議，多家中國大型品牌先後宣佈終止與其合作。姆巴佩發表道歉聲明也不被中國網民接納。</summary></entry><entry><title>劉延東逝世：「紅二代」「團派」背景，政治局裡少見的女性身影</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2038dd7pzxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T14:51:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2038dd7pzxo/trad--63737cb7d80f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2038dd7pzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">劉延東的逝世提醒外界一個現象：從吳儀、劉延東到孫春蘭，中共中央政治局曾連續20年保持至少一名女性委員，直到2022年「二十大」中斷，權力核心再無女性。</summary></entry><entry><title>官方統計：中國「養老」人數首次超過「養小」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxl4xq52dxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T08:26:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxl4xq52dxo/trad--9a8d93c06840.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxl4xq52dxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析人士指出，最新數字標誌著中國應對人口老化的重要里程碑。</summary></entry><entry><title>「盧拉軍團」的WhatsApp聊天群如何扭轉巴西選情</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T14:40:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad--5b6029846225.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">雖然民調顯示敗局已定，但數百萬巴西人加入了「盧拉軍團」頻道，後者被認為幫助將線上熱情轉化為現實世界的動員。</summary></entry><entry><title>住着一群代孕孩子，美國加州的豪宅如何變成「恐怖之家」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T03:26:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad--f229e1128309.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國加州一棟豪宅因男嬰受傷揭發涉嫌虐童案，屋內住着多名透過代孕出生的孩子。涉案男女被控串謀虐待兒童，事件亦引發外界關注美國代孕產業的監管問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>武契奇14年執政落幕，中塞「鐵桿友誼」何去何從？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T08:05:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad--bbb377741910.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從總理到總統，武契奇領導的塞爾維亞進步黨（SNS）一步步將塞爾維亞打造成歐洲強硬的親華國家，中國亦曾形容兩國關係為「鐵桿友誼 」。外界關注這一親華總統敗選，將如何改變中塞關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>巴黎騷亂中的三位華人：「激烈的地方激烈，安靜的地方安靜」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T08:59:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad--3d682414cab9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">三位受訪者表示，暴力事件集中於示威區域，市民日常生活並未受到太大影響。但他們對政府能否平息抗議並不樂觀，甚至有人預計，隨著冬季來臨、生活成本上漲，示威還會陸續出現。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普治下，美國經濟的真實表現如何？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T00:21:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad--22ae89b6b05b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中期選舉前夕，特朗普一直吹噓美國經濟的表現。 BBC事實查核（BBC Verify）調查美國的通貨膨脹、就業和經濟成長。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港演員鍾雪瑩、袁澧林發聲之後，她們親述被性別冒犯的經歷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T04:37:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad--b44a6d14686f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文訪問了四位來自不同行業的女性，了解言語冒犯是如何在工作環境中出現；當性別冒犯被包裝成「玩笑」，她們是如何應對。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉解讀：「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>如何不刻意鍛煉，也能增加活動量？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T00:20:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad--2e35c9832285.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日常零星活動正顯現出保護健康的強大作用，其效果令人意外。它有助於我們消耗更多熱量，降低患心血管疾病的風險，甚至降低死亡風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼時候「豪華經濟艙」值得多花錢？來比較2026年全球五強</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T08:27:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad--c7b431e0bccb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球豪經艙排名出來，台灣長榮及阿聯酋航空分佔冠亞軍。</summary></entry><entry><title>觀鳥如何重塑大腦，延緩認知衰退？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T06:30:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad--bfe79e2154f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">觀鳥近年愈來愈受長者和認知障礙症患者歡迎。研究人員分析這項活動對他們的身心健康有何影響，以及可能帶來哪些益處。</summary></entry><entry><title>華東颱風強、印尼野火烈——厄爾尼諾現象影響世界的五個方面</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T13:14:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad--e85bdbc86403.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有記錄以來最強的厄爾尼諾現象持續增強之際，全球各地已經感受到哪些天氣模式方面的影響？BBC首席氣象預報員莎拉·基斯—盧卡斯（Sarah Keith-Lucas）檢視相關證據。</summary></entry><entry><title>翻看英國統計 為何從未吸煙的人也開始對電子煙上癮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-31T14:36:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T00:17:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad--619daa0b0a2c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">根據英國國家統計局（ONS）數據，目前有超過100萬名電子煙使用者過去從未吸煙。</summary></entry></feed>
